  "description": "The Borealis Flume offers the best fat bike value on the market. This expedition-ready fatty mirrors the Crestone geometry, but does so in lightweight, 6000-series aluminum. Up mountains, down glaciers, and across deserts - the Flume is ready for action. There are all kinds of alloy fat bikes on the market, but none with the Flume’s purebred heritage and durability.HIGHLIGHTS\nTraditional fat bike geometry is both responsive and nimble for variable conditions in snow or sand.\nStandard features include: Eagle NX 12-Speed drivetrain, rigid carbon fork, carbon handlebars, carbon seat post and durable Sun-Ringle Mulefut rims.\nTire clearance up to 26x5” and 27.5x4.5”.\nCompatibility for 100-120mm of suspension travel for increased comfort and control.\nLightweight, 6000-series aluminum frame comes with 3 bottle cage mounts, rear rack mounts on seat stays and Lizard Skin protectors on both the down tube and drive-side chain stay.\nAvailable in two colorways\nReduced stand over height\nFrames include:\nChainstay and seatstay protectors\nSeatpost collar\nRear axle\nDerailleur hanger\nFrame with Fork includes all of the above as well as:\nFork of your choice\nComplete headset assembly with compression plug / star nut\nFront axle\nAll frames are covered by a LIFETIME warranty and crash replacement program.",
